From: awto-claudia
Subject: [a2 TEST ONLY, #79] ARM: mm: v7 UP section flags write-allocate (PMD_FLAGS_UP = WBWA)

Test for the a2 corruption above 100 MHz; not applied by build_mainline.py (subdirectory).
mmu.c cachepolicy default is overridden by init_default_cache_policy() from these flags.
Build: tmp/mainline/build-a2wa (config of build-normal).
---
diff --git a/arch/arm/mm/proc-v7-2level.S b/arch/arm/mm/proc-v7-2level.S
index 1007702fcaf3..6a2c3ef1500f 100644
--- a/arch/arm/mm/proc-v7-2level.S
+++ b/arch/arm/mm/proc-v7-2level.S
@@ -18,7 +18,7 @@
 
 /* PTWs cacheable, inner WB not shareable, outer WB not shareable */
 #define TTB_FLAGS_UP	TTB_IRGN_WB|TTB_RGN_OC_WB
-#define PMD_FLAGS_UP	PMD_SECT_WB
+#define PMD_FLAGS_UP	PMD_SECT_WBWA
 
 /* PTWs cacheable, inner WBWA shareable, outer WBWA not shareable */
 #define TTB_FLAGS_SMP	TTB_IRGN_WBWA|TTB_S|TTB_NOS|TTB_RGN_OC_WBWA
